heir and they were so helpful! I got the Mint Kahlua Chip and my fiancé got the burnt sourdough. We both loved it and they have new flavors every week! As well as savory food. This is a must try"},{"business_id":"ExsllWnzwpg-I9__sOm0aQ","review_id":"pHTzFto5H9CyAZD-tV49oQ","date":"2021-05-19T02:28:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9123307466506958,"text_excerpt":"Located inside Courtyard Brewery this spot is slinging some of the most ambitious and delicious ice cream in New Orleans. Be sure to follow them on Instagram for their limited releases (such as a recent Baked Alaska ice cream cake). They also do sundaes every Sunday now."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
